  },
  "$heroSlotsComment": "Artwork is stored at its native resolution and WebP quality 95: visually indistinguishable from the source PNG and about a tenth of the weight. It is deliberately not downscaled, because a showcase storefront is judged on how the artwork looks. Each tone is sampled from the top of its own image and darkened so white copy clears the contrast floor, which makes the panel and its artwork read as one object.",
